# KHFinaM UI Rules

- Avoid boring CRUD layouts
- Prefer analytics-first dashboard
- Prefer cards over tables
- Use ApexCharts heavily
- Every dashboard page must contain charts
- Mobile-first design mandatory
- Use Material Design inspired spacing
- Use premium fintech aesthetics
- Prefer glassmorphism lightly
- Use gradients subtly
- Use dark mode optimized layouts
- Avoid plain white screens
- Use KPI cards extensively
- Use sparkline mini charts
- Use responsive grids
- Avoid large boring forms
- Use segmented forms/cards
- Add microinteractions
- Prefer expandable transaction cards
- Avoid excessive text density
- Use financial visual hierarchy
- Use animated counters
- Use sticky mobile action buttons
- Use bottom mobile navigation
- Prefer visually rich analytics panels